{"title":"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 22","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> is a rectangle, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> is the center of the circle, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> is on the circle.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/0/820bf77420841403304ea0b1c6eadf5e50bd1b36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"62\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/6/746fe6b6679f693c884c68a86c6dabd02ee2c299.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD=3$\" width=\"62\" height=\"12\" />, then the area of the shaded region is between\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/f/34f83e970acc786d0c8e91464cc6120d79fc07aa.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] pair A,B,C,D; A=(0,4); B=(3,4); C=(3,0); D=origin; draw(circle(D,5)); fill((0,5)..(1.5,4.7697)..B--A--cycle,black); fill(B..(4,3)..(5,0)--C--cycle,black); draw((0,5)--D--(5,0)); label(&quot;A&quot;,A,NW); label(&quot;B&quot;,B,NE); label(&quot;C&quot;,C,S); label(&quot;D&quot;,D,SW); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"252\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/c/52ca325f0206799874ac511b95f2672c2a497c22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 4\\text{ and }5 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 5\\text{ and }6 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 6\\text{ and }7 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 7\\text{ and }8 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 8\\text{ and }9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"564\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> is a rectangle, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/6/016e707581a8b465355a0f7ddfc7e59cf9455a7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC = AD = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"118\" height=\"14\" />.  So by the Pythagorean theorem, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/4/0149b340cf493bcff7f1b6e46de9499272180f02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD = \\sqrt{BC^2 + CD^2} = \\sqrt{3^2+4^2} = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"295\" height=\"21\" />.  So, the circle has radius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and total area <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/1/0416ff27b1dfb17b672a12d0314ec8bfd9fe8b77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25\\pi$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" />.  Consequently, the quarter circle bounded by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/1/ae15cd6fc137587ad1676133c8342dc210dc6364.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> has area <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/a/82aaadb94f39e2ad69501f90e1afec8a3672ba16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{25\\pi}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"35\" height=\"38\" />.  \n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> has area <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/4/4d4ca54ab08f1bcaeba2f971a6f613e62372f272.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\cdot 4=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" />, the shaded area is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/a/68a47d9e3665f591ca41ffff69e230e835176530.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{25\\pi}{4}-12 \\approx \\frac{25 \\cdot 3.14}{4} - 12 = 7.625$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"273\" height=\"38\" />, so the area is between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/3/1c350e1664a25c3b76d2bedb9a8db9ddfe58b3a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{7 and 8}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"103\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME\" title=\"1987 AJHSME\">1987 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1987\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Prob